content:{date:"Dec 30, 2025",headline:"Assort Health improves healthcare access by automating millions of patient calls with Gemini 2.5 Flash",Vu:"Assort Health's AI agents use Gemini 2.5 Flash to handle a wide range of patient interactions, leading to lower wait times and increased appointment bookings.",Ef:[{name:"Jon Wang",role:"Founder and Co-CEO, Assort Health"},{name:"Jeffery Liu",role:"Founder and Co-CEO, Assort Health"},{name:"Sean Muirhead",role:"Agent Engineering Lead, Assort Health"},{name:"Vishal Dharmadhikari",
